        explain: 'doubt 用于肯定句时接 whether 表“是否”；that 表示内容是确定的，与“仍有疑问”矛盾。',
      },
      {
        q: 'We have not settled the question ____ the museum is open to visitors on Monday.',
        opts: ['if', 'that', 'which', 'whether'],
